{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今（16日）凌晨3時許，警方接報屯門田景路發生交通意外，據悉一輛輕貨車沿田景路往鳴琴路方向行駛，其間撞向路旁一個長約2米的欄杆。</p><p>警方接報到場，發現該名姓劉（41歲）的男司機身上有酒氣。經初步調查，劉男未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T19:47:05.175623+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T19:36:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T05:47:27.036067+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T19:40:18.623359+00:00","content_hash":"8397314514a7b8111d966da3e516ea536eba8d16f8d82cfa7622083cdfff6b81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}